# Pairs with HandOffBound. Moved from the design's ReadPositionHonestNoOpenCheck.
# The design dropped the owner's check of the open marker; here the owner's read
# is the marker itself, so the same hole is a hand-off whose open L cannot see:
# the initiator admits writes and they are allocated while L's marker reads
# closed, above the head the last close recorded.
MODULE: HandOffBoundNoOpenCheck
TARGET: HandOffBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the initiator starts admitting without opening L's marker
PERTURBS: ForeignOpen

--- FIND
    /\ hoOpen' = TRUE
    /\ fAdmit' = TRUE
    /\ windows' = windows + 1
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the marker the owner reads is not opened.
    /\ hoOpen' = hoOpen
    /\ fAdmit' = TRUE
    /\ windows' = windows + 1
--- END
